# This is an example of rmscript to check behind the robot and take a picture

# Description of the tool, will be passed to the LLM
DESCRIPTION Robot turns around to look behind itself and take a picture with its camera

# Turn to look behind
turn left 160
wait 4s

# Take a picture
play yummy
wait 4s
play yummy
wait 4s
play yummy
wait 4s
picture

# Return to center
wait 4s
turn center
